Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.26,0:00:05.82,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,4740,5540)\pos(640,334.6)}Episode 81
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.26,0:00:05.82,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,4740,5540)\pos(640,512.8)}Sima Zhao Commits Regicide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:16.00,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After Jiang Wei of Western Shu \Nwas defeated at Mount Tielong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:21.97,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,he organized an army to advance\N on Mount Qi again in 255 CE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:25.76,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After receiving the news, Sima Zhao ordered Deng Ai to move towards Mount Qi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:30.61,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and garrison at the southern banks \Nof the Wei River so as to block Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:31.94,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Convey my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:33.42,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:34.03,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:37.13,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,General Sima, we shall lead\N the rear troops as support.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:38.64,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Do not act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:39.04,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:39.90,Default,General,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:41.98,Default,General,0,0,0,,They are using Marquis Zhuge's \NEight Trigrams formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.98,0:00:43.86,Default,General,0,0,0,,It is hard to predict due to it being ever changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:48.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4980,5340)\pos(289.333,458.667}Dèng Ài\NStyled: Shìzài
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:46.51,Default,General,0,0,0,,If we are to attack them, we must be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:48.98,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:54.51,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:03.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.667,482.667)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:34.82,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,General Deng!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:37.70,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Why hesitate and not advance?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:40.08,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Do you perhaps fear this formation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:44.16,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,That is the Eight Trigrams formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.06,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,How is it ingenious? What is intimidating about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:59.22,Default,General,0,0,0,,That is good control of the Eight Trigrams formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.91,0:02:09.51,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,General Deng, do you recognize this new formation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:15.72,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,How is that daunting? That is the Heaven formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:20.77,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:24.01,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,May it please you, General, to observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:39.26,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,What is this formation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:42.30,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Do you know it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:46.11,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Do not be so presumptuous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:53.07,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Its main color is yellow, representing \Nthe Earth. That is a square formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.82,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,What a pity that you are like a frog inside a well!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.93,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,How could you know the genius of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:03:02.28,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,That formation would only fool children. \NWhat is ingenious about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:08.18,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,If that is the case, enter the\N formation to see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.46,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,You think I cannot break your formation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:31.07,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,General Deng, you are a perceptive\N and righteous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:33.28,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Why not dismount and surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:37.80,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,We could destroy Sima Zhao and recover \N the rivers and mountains for the Great Han!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:40.24,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Enough of your mad ramblings!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:41.61,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:44.66,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:48.18,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,General Deng!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:52.69,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Capture Deng Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.85,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Run away now, General Deng!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:05.89,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Father, get on the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:41.80,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General, how are your injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:45.47,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Not bothersome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:49.50,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I only fear that the Shu army \Nstrengthened their momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.95,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Now it may be hard for us to repel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:54.70,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,What is the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:06:00.50,Default,General,0,0,0,,Right now, the Lord of Shu, Liu Shan, \Nand his favored eunuch, Huang Hao,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:03.00,Default,General,0,0,0,,are amusing themselves with wine and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.26,0:06:06.28,Default,General,0,0,0,,We should plan to sow discord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:10.70,Default,General,0,0,0,,We would communicate with\N Huang Hao to spread rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:16.74,Default,General,0,0,0,,This will instill doubt in the Lord of Shu \Nand cause him to recall Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:19.02,Default,General,0,0,0,,This would solve this urgent situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:24.19,Default,Huang Hao,0,0,0,,Sir, please look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:30.59,Default,Huang Hao,0,0,0,,That messenger is leaving the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:34.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5020,5380)\pos(249.333,490.667}Dǎng Jūn
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:33.22,Default,Huang Hao,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei will be recalled very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:40.67,Default,Dang Jun,0,0,0,,It is fortunate that you work hard for your nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:44.66,Default,Dang Jun,0,0,0,,You may have just eliminated a hidden threat to Shu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.26,0:06:49.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4060,4380)\pos(957.333,484}Huáng Hào
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:49.37,Default,Huang Hao,0,0,0,,Sir, you may return to deliver our command.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:55.90,Default,Dang Jun,0,0,0,,A long way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:58.42,Default,Dang Jun,0,0,0,,We will meet again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:00.82,Default,Dang Jun,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:10.77,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,In this expedition,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.77,0:07:12.65,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,we have seized nine camps at Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:15.90,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Victory is imminent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:18.74,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,His Majesty wants our army to return to the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:20.73,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I do not know his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:23.56,Default,General,0,0,0,,In campaigns, a general does not have to obey orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:26.79,Default,General,0,0,0,,Even with the edict, we cannot abandon this halfway!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:27.90,Default,General,0,0,0,,If we return our army...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:29.94,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,Do not say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:32.63,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,If you disobey, you will aggravate the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:35.73,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,I fear this will beget accidents that will not help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:37.18,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,Better to accept this victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:39.87,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,return with the army, and ease the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.49,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,We can devise plans later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:44.19,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,What you said is fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.22,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Your Majesty has summoned me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:48.83,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,so I have returned my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:50.54,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,May I know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:53.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.667,474.667)}Líu Shàn\NStyled: Gōngsì
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:58.58,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,You have been outside with your army for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:00.94,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,We feared that they were getting too exhausted,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:03.30,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,so We have summoned you back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:06.14,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,There is no ulterior motive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:10.30,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I have seized nine camps at Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:14.57,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I was about to render major deeds, \Nbut I did not expect to abandon them halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:18.15,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you must have fallen\N for Deng Ai's plan to sow discord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.86,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,You are too suspicious, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:30.24,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I shall suppress the traitors with all my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:34.38,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,continuing the wishes of Chancellor Zhuge\N and repaying the nation's favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:37.30,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, do not heed the words of villains,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:39.86,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,lest you develop doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:42.83,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,No no no, I do not doubt you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:46.31,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Please go back to Hanzhong and \Nawait for Wei to experience turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:49.42,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,It would not be too late to invade Wei once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:23.43,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:36.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5020,5420)\pos(308,462.667)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:40.02,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.65,0:09:43.88,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui and Jia Chong wish to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:44.82,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:45.25,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:46.70,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:57.13,Default,Jia Chong & Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Grand Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:10:01.47,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Grand Commander, the invading army\N of Shu has withdrawn to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:04.00,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,General Deng Ai has sent this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:08.56,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei has withdrawn his army to Hanzhong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:14.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3580,3900)\pos(960,441.333)}Jiǎ Chōng\NStyled: Gōnglǘ
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:11.78,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:14.14,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,He won the battle, but withdrew his troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:19.63,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,General Deng's inference was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:24.07,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}There is disunity between\N Shu's lord and their subjects,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:28.29,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}the court indulges in wine and women, and the eunuch Huang Hao is trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:30.66,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}They will have turmoil in the long run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:35.32,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}I just wonder how the people of Shu are feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:40.07,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12}An envoy of Wu summarized Shu \Nwith these words after his visit:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:44.40,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}"In their court, I did not hear upright words."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:47.58,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}"In their fields, the people looked famished."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:48.93,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}There is a saying for this:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.93,0:10:53.22,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Swallows and sparrows reside in the hall, \Nunaware of the impeding fire in the mansion!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.98,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Would now be a good time to invade?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:11:00.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3780,4140)\pos(998.667,510.667)}Zhōng Huì\NStyled: Shìjì
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:57.90,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:00.19,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,The Emperor is suspicious of you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.19,0:11:03.72,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,If you leave court now, I fear there would be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:10.42,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Does His Majesty suspect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:19.60,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Allow me to take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:37.90,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:39.81,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:43.96,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Please look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.62,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)\i1}The Poem of the Lying Dragon?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:52.86,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Who wrote this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:57.65,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Last year, a yellow dragon was\N sighted inside a well at Ningling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.89,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Court officials petitioned to celebrate,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:03.53,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but the Emperor said that it was an ill omen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:05.55,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Dragons are the symbols of monarchs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:09.05,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12}As this one was not in the \Nsky above or the fields below,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:11.37,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}instead limiting its majesty inside a well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.37,0:12:13.49,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he thought it was a sign of him being trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:16.02,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Hence, he wrote the {\i1}The Poem of the Lying Dragon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:20.20,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The poem obviously references you, my lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:23.07,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}so how have you not noticed this yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:28.42,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"How weak the dragon is to be trapped!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:30.51,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"He is unable to leap out of the deep abyss."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.51,0:12:34.19,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"He cannot fly to the Heavens above \Nor be seen in the fields below."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:37.44,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"He curls up inside a well, \Neels and loaches dancing before him."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.30,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"So he must hide his teeth and claws."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.86,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Alas, I am alike to him!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:49.65,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Alas, I am alike to him..."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:56.62,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He actually called me an eel and loach!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:04.96,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Does he want to end up like Cao Fang?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:11.01,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If I do not eliminate him now, he will surely harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.19,0:13:14.67,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,I am willing to eliminate him for you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:28.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3140,3460)\pos(353.333,449.333)}Cáo Máo\NStyled: Yànshì
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:37.24,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:52.03,Default,Official,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, your ministers have petitioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:56.94,Default,Official,0,0,0,,They petition for the Grand General to be made \NDuke of Jin and given the Nine Bestowments.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:07.10,Default,Official,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, as his merits are peerless,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:09.33,Default,Official,0,0,0,,make him the Duke of Jin\N and give the Nine Bestowments!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:14.97,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Please give him the fief, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:38.50,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,My father, my older brother, and I\N have rendered major deeds to Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:41.62,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,In making me Duke of Jin now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:44.71,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,is there anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:47.65,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,Dare I not respect that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.36,0:14:54.81,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,This poem about the "lying dragon"...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:59.02,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,It seemed to regard us as eels and loaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.13,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:32.44,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you must not! You must not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:35.48,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Everyone knows what Sima Zhao is thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:38.73,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}He has oppressed Us for too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:42.18,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660) }We are the Son of Heaven of the Great Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:45.23,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}And yet, he summons and dismisses Us at will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:51.22,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}He does so as if We were a mere servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:54.38,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}How can We tolerate this sort of humiliation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:15:59.97,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, calm-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:02.50,Default,Wang Ye,0,0,0,,Be careful, what if someone else hears this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:04.71,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,We are not afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:10.31,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,We have made up my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:13.12,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,Help Us march forward to eliminate that traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:15.39,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:17.78,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,The Sima clan has held power for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:20.20,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,The ministers would not want to follow your path.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:24.49,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,Moreover, Your Majesty does not have \Nmany guards and you have no capable men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:28.76,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,If you cannot tolerate them, disaster will befall you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:32.75,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,You must follow this plan and not act recklessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:40.91,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,You may tolerate it, but We will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:46.35,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,Our mind is set!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.71,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,What is there to fear in death!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:58.74,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:08.42,Default,Wang Ye,0,0,0,,This is an urgent situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:12.18,Default,Wang Ye,0,0,0,,We cannot bring disaster upon ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:23.31,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,Let us hasten towards Lord Sima's mansion to inform him, so that we may be spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:24.26,Default,Wang Jing,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:31.62,Default,Wang Jing,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When the lord is troubled,\N his servants should feel shame;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:33.92,Default,Wang Jing,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}when the lord feels shame, his servants should die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:37.10,Default,Wang Jing,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}You two would actually dare be duplicitous?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:43.99,Default,Wang Jing,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.73,0:17:47.22,Default,Wang Jing,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:12.60,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,We are the Son of Heaven of the Great Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.62,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,You are charging into Our palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:16.42,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,Are you trying to rebel against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:25.18,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Cheng Ji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:29.53,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Lord Sima has trained you for this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:32.04,Default,Cheng Ji,0,0,0,,Am I to kill or to capture?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:34.77,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Lord Sima orders you to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:44.65,Default,Cao Mao,0,0,0,,You lout! You dare to act in impudence?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:45.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(974.667,498.667)}Chéng Jì
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:50.00,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Cheng Ji, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:55.15,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:07.47,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:15.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4300,4700)\pos(289.333,458.667}Wáng Jīng\NStyled: Yànwěi
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:16.26,Default,Wang Jing,0,0,0,,You all dared kill your lord?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.34,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Detain him and report this to Lord Sima.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:21.58,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Send for my carriage and horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:22.98,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I shall enter the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.98,0:19:23.66,Default,Servants,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:25.75,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Where are you, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:28.39,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Where are you, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where are you, Your Majesty?\N-Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:36.22,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:38.90,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:40.95,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:42.22,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:49.15,Default,All,0,0,0,,-Grand General!\N-Lord Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.15,0:19:53.52,Default,All,0,0,0,,Wake up, Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:19:58.46,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:00.29,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:03.76,Default,All,0,0,0,,Our condolences, Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:06.78,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,When Your Majesty was in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:11.23,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I failed to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:21.08,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I only ask to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:26.08,Default,Wang Ye,0,0,0,,Our condolences, Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.89,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,To repay the kindness of my nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:32.05,Default,All,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.05,0:20:34.94,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,The death of His Majesty leaves us with no lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:38.20,Default,Wang Ye,0,0,0,,Grand General, you should arrange the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:40.01,Default,Wang Chen,0,0,0,,Yes, Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:50.11,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,In that case, I invite all you worthy ministers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.11,0:20:55.42,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,to hold a grand funeral in\N the East Hall for His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:59.28,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,We will discuss matters afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:00.66,Default,Wang Chen & Wang Ye,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.68,0:21:09.92,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Sire, Deputy Secretary Chen Tai has not arrived yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:14.14,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Send for him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:14.82,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:47.90,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,All of you beloved ministers,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:55.21,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,the death of His Majesty leaves us with no lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:22:00.00,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.33,0:22:04.86,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:12.42,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:21.23,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,My condolences, Master Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:28.97,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Regarding what happened today...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:35.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5580,5940)\pos(304,465.333}Chén Tài\NStyled: Xuánbó
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.19,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,How should we deal with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:42.34,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,The only way is to kill Jia Chong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:43.92,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,That will appease the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.32,0:22:48.37,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Is there no other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:49.62,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,Just this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.30,0:22:51.86,Default,Chen Tai,0,0,0,,There should be no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:56.98,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:02.10,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Take Cheng Ji away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.96,0:23:03.38,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:07.21,Default,Cheng Ji,0,0,0,,My lord, I am guiltless! I am guiltless!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.21,0:23:07.65,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.49,0:23:13.45,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Cheng Ji murdered his liege, \Na treasonous and immoral act.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.64,0:23:16.86,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Chop him into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.00,0:23:19.87,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Exterminate his clan to the third degree!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.87,0:23:20.90,Default,Cheng Ji,0,0,0,,Vile traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:23.30,Default,Cheng Ji,0,0,0,,It was Jia Chong who gave the order to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.30,0:23:26.58,Default,Cheng Ji,0,0,0,,How am I guilty? Traitor bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.58,0:23:28.47,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,That slanderous mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.47,0:23:30.14,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Remove his tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.67,0:23:31.62,Default,Cheng Ji,0,0,0,,Vile traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:35.18,Default,Cheng Ji,0,0,0,,You made me murder because\N you want to become emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:38.72,Default,Cheng Ji,0,0,0,,Treacherous bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.01,0:23:49.61,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Secretary Wang Jing has slandered trusted officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.61,0:23:52.90,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,He fearmongered His Majesty into leaving the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.90,0:23:54.29,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Such a crime is not light!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:23:57.66,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,He shall be sent to the Minister\N of Justice for execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.82,0:23:59.50,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,His clan shall be exterminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.62,0:24:38.50,Default,Wang Jing,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.93,0:25:32.83,Default,All,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.41,0:26:01.94,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Excellencies, Ministers, and other grandees,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.94,0:26:07.84,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12}as three men of the Sima clan have merits that have benefited all of creation,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:10.28,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Lord Sima should accept Wei's abdication
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.28,0:26:12.86,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}and ascend to become the Son of Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.52,0:26:20.28,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}We should entreat Lord Sima to \Naccept abdication and become emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.90,0:26:33.66,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}We officials entreat Lord Sima to \Naccept abdication and become emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.82,0:26:49.81,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In the past, King Wen of Zhou held two-thirds of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.65,0:26:54.85,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Nevertheless, his ministers still served Shang.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.85,0:26:58.76,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Thus, posterity praised him as a paragon of virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.76,0:27:02.44,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Just as Emperor Wu of Wei\N did not accept abdication from the Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.44,0:27:05.78,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}I shall also not accept abdication from the Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.00,0:27:08.37,Default,Official,0,0,0,,... So he wishes to leave the throne to his son?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.37,0:27:12.06,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Lord Sima is the most virtuous man of our era!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.06,0:27:14.56,Default,All,0,0,0,,Lord Sima, you are most able and exalted!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.56,0:27:17.70,Default,All,0,0,0,,You have the support of everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.35,0:27:21.77,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the year 260 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.77,0:27:27.22,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao installed the Prince of Yan, grandson of Cao Cao and the son of Cao Yu, as Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.22,0:27:30.25,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,at thirteen and a half years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.25,0:27:33.65,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The era name was changed to \Nthe first year of the Jingyuan era.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.58,0:27:35.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(340,422.667)}Cáo Huàn\NStyled: Jǐngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.65,0:27:39.84,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,When Jiang Wei heard that Sima Zhao killed Cao Mao\N and installed Cao Huan as emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.84,0:27:44.60,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,he allied with Eastern Wu to \Nmuster troops for Sima Zhao's punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.60,0:27:47.64,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Battling at Mount Qi, he crushed Deng Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.64,0:27:51.38,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,However, his food ran out and\N the gallery roads were destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.38,0:27:53.46,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He thus could only return to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.28,0:27:58.75,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the winter of 262 CE, Jiang Wei assembled an army,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.75,0:28:03.81,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,petitioning to the Latter Lord\N to invade the central plains a ninth time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.94,0:28:04.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(904,498.667)}Líu Shàn\NStyled: Gōngsì
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.97,0:28:12.70,Default,Huang Hao,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Grand General Jiang Wei requests to invade Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:14.37,Default,Huang Hao,0,0,0,,He desires for your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.49,0:28:29.38,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}"In my numerous expeditions,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.38,0:28:32.84,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"though I did not accomplish \Ngreat deeds, I demoralized Wei."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.84,0:28:36.34,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"We have been training for so long, we will \Nget tired without a fight and become ill."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.34,0:28:39.20,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}"Moreover, the soldiers wish to die to serve you."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.20,0:28:42.02,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}"If I do not succeed, punish me with death."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.02,0:28:46.19,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, our army has been attacking Wei for years, and the people are exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.94,0:28:50.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(390.667,470.667)}Xì Zhèng\NStyled: Lìngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:47.39,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,We would be losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.39,0:28:50.10,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,Why not garrison troops at fields\N to wait for an opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.10,0:28:53.78,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,The Grand General wishes to ally\N with Wu and muster troops together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.78,0:28:58.26,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,I heard that Sun Liang has been deposed \Nin favor of Sun Xiu becoming emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.26,0:29:01.29,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,With its ministers being locked in a power struggle,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.29,0:29:04.14,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,they will not have any spare time to invade Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.44,0:29:07.79,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Your words are most right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.78,0:29:13.46,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I gazed at the Heavens at night, and\N I saw that in the astrological zone of Shu,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.46,0:29:15.49,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}the stars were dim and not shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.49,0:29:20.42,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}Now if he wishes to march out again, he will be at a great disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.42,0:29:23.58,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,But he has already made up his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.10,0:29:28.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3940,4300)\pos(618.667,448}Qiáo Zhōu\NStyled: Yǔnnán
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.58,0:29:26.59,Default,Qiao Zhou,0,0,0,,He may repeat the same mistakes and lose again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.80,0:29:30.67,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,If he does lose, it will not be too late to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.18,0:29:35.78,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,We hereby order him to lead 300,000\N soldiers to invade the central plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.67,0:29:53.86,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I received orders to march out to subdue \Nwicked traitors and restore the central plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.56,0:30:01.14,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Generals, in this campaign, where shall we advance to?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.42,0:30:01.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2220,2620)\pos(301.333,490.667}Liào Huà\NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.81,0:30:04.71,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Years of warfare have disturbed the army and people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.71,0:30:08.14,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12}His Majesty trusts Huang Hao {\bord12}and the officials are disunited.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.14,0:30:10.87,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Moreover, the general of Wei, Deng Ai, is cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.87,0:30:12.49,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}He is no ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.41,0:30:16.20,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, you want to force something that should not be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.18,0:30:21.17,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}I... I am not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.33,0:30:26.45,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Chancellor marched to Mount Qi \Nsix times in service to our empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.31,0:30:29.26,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}I have done nine expeditions!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.26,0:30:31.22,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}How could they be for my own sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.22,0:30:33.74,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Did you forget what happened\N when we invaded last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.74,0:30:37.66,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Our army secured a great victory, but \NDeng Ai deployed a strategy to sow discord,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.66,0:30:41.07,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}He communicated with Huang Hao to spread rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.07,0:30:44.61,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12}claiming that you resented the \Nemperor and would surrender to Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.61,0:30:49.50,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12}His Majesty ordered the army to return, \Npreventing us from success at the last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.98,0:30:59.21,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, you are indeed loyal and true to \Nthe Chancellor's dying wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.21,0:31:01.98,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Yet in this expedition, even if you win...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.54,0:31:04.54,Default,Liao Hua,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}The imperial court...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.80,0:31:11.41,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}General Liao.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.19,0:31:14.62,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}I shall go ahead and seize Taoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.62,0:31:16.85,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}You will remain to guard Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.85,0:31:18.53,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Grand General, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.62,0:31:42.38,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Taoyang is a vast area with\N few people and low production.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:45.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5620,5940)\pos(388,484}Xiàhóu Bà\NStyled: Zhòngquán
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.38,0:31:45.57,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Deng Ai will not send a large force to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.57,0:31:49.34,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,We will win the battle due to his obliviousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.34,0:31:50.90,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Our next step...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.58,0:31:54.84,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Our next step is to accumulate food and ally with the Qiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.84,0:31:59.30,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,We need Taoyang to seize the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.30,0:32:00.90,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,A brilliant move, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.77,0:32:07.32,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Only, if this tactic of ours is revealed, Deng Ai will send troops to counter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:11.50,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I had wanted to let him know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.50,0:32:13.63,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,As he has a firm grasp on military tactics,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.63,0:32:18.53,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,he would think that my attack on Taoyang was a ruse, and that I was going for Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.53,0:32:23.13,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,He would sent troops to defend it, \Nmaking Taoyang easy to capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.13,0:32:27.47,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,General, Deng Ai has miscalculated this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.89,0:32:35.54,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General Deng has ordered that our work must be completed by midnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.54,0:32:37.63,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,The army of Shu-Han has left Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.63,0:32:40.33,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,appearing to attack Taoyang \Nbut really seeking Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.33,0:32:44.22,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Soldiers of the nine camps,\N step up your defenses and be on high alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.44,0:33:15.01,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General, we have warned four villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.01,0:33:17.59,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,If Jiang Wei attacks, they will escape immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.49,0:33:24.38,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.98,0:33:29.25,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General, we have mobilized fine warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.25,0:33:31.49,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,They will come to help us defend Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.13,0:33:37.57,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,General, please rest in your tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.57,0:33:40.11,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,A great battle is imminent, so you must take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.60,0:33:46.48,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,General Sima, do you think Jiang Wei \Nactually came to take the nine camps at Mount Qi?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.77,0:33:49.81,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei is full of tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.81,0:33:51.57,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,He is just bluffing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.51,0:33:55.09,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,He seems to be attacking Taoyang, but he actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.01,0:34:00.11,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Warfare is full of bluffs and falsehoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.11,0:34:02.46,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Falsehoods are deceitful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.46,0:34:04.74,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,As for truths...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.74,0:34:07.56,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,they themselves are not too far from being deceitful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.18,0:34:13.79,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,Is Jiang Wei really going for Taoyang?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.79,0:34:17.67,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,He always attacks places where I have food.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.67,0:34:19.29,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Now that Taoyang has no food,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.29,0:34:22.77,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,he thinks I will guard Mount Qi, not Taoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.77,0:34:25.38,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,He would win the battle due to our obliviousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.38,0:34:30.19,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,He will then accumulate food and ally with the Qiang as his longterm plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.05,0:34:34.34,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,If that is really the case, what shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.86,0:34:44.91,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,We withdraw all the troops here and \Nsplit them into two groups to rescue Taoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.32,0:34:49.49,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Twenty-five {\i1}li{\i0} is about 12.5 kilometers or eight miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.32,0:34:49.49,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Twenty-five {\i1}li{\i0} from Taoyang is the small town of Houhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.49,0:34:51.49,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,It is a chokepoint for Taoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.49,0:34:54.54,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,You can lead an army to\N lay an ambush in Taoyang city.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.54,0:34:57.94,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,You will lay down your flags and open the four gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.02,0:35:03.82,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I will lead an army to lay an ambush at Houhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:06.71,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,We will ensure a great victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.56,0:35:10.14,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.14,0:35:10.99,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.53,0:35:13.71,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Deng Ai has strengthened the camps at Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.71,0:35:17.58,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,He has recruited the strong of four villages, \Nthreatening an attack on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.58,0:35:18.28,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Investigate!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.28,0:35:18.74,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.03,0:35:23.65,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,General Deng, pardon me for not joining you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.82,0:35:27.30,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,General Xiahou, you may be our front.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.30,0:35:30.44,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Lead an army to seize Taoyang in a decisive battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.44,0:35:30.95,Default,Xiahou Ba,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:51.73,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,General, Jiang Wei of Shu has led a large army \Nbefore our camp to pick a fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.22,0:35:56.89,Default,General,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei was defeated at Taoyang,\N so he must be here to take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.89,0:36:00.26,Default,General,0,0,0,,He has no care for his soldiers, fighting day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.26,0:36:05.24,Default,General,0,0,0,,General, if we march out now, \Nwe will secure a resounding victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.24,0:36:08.86,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Father, when we fought him yesterday,\N the outcome was inconclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.86,0:36:10.72,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Now that he has come again to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.72,0:36:13.75,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,I wish to lead a group of men to fight him to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.75,0:36:16.48,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,If I do not win, I would submit myself to military law.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.48,0:36:20.20,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,General, I will go! I will go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.95,0:36:27.82,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Deng Zhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.56,0:36:29.29,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.29,0:36:31.92,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Order the whole army to guard the camp strictly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.92,0:36:33.97,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Do not allow anyone to leave to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.78,0:36:37.51,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Anyone who disobeys will be beheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.51,0:36:38.25,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.31,0:36:42.53,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei has a firm grasp on \NZhuge Kongming's techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.57,0:36:48.68,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,We must beware his schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.94,0:36:51.49,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Go now to relay my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.61,0:36:54.17,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.98,0:37:03.43,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Calf of Deng Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.43,0:37:09.40,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Go run back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.03,0:37:15.73,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Run back, calf!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.88,0:37:28.45,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,That calf Deng Zhong sure is lacking in manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.48,0:37:30.49,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Prepare the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.17,0:37:34.30,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.30,0:37:36.29,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,The detestable Jiang Wei is mocking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.29,0:37:38.11,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,I will make sure I capture him alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.89,0:37:55.31,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I did not think Jiang Wei would look into my past this accurately.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.66,0:38:01.52,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}I lost my father when I was only twelve years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.52,0:38:05.01,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}so I pastured cattle to support my elderly mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.01,0:38:09.24,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}By studying hard, I have gotten to where I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.66,0:38:14.88,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I brought up cattle to make a living, so I naturally cherish livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:20.48,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12}There is no shame in understanding \Nthe feelings and reasoning of others!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.61,0:38:26.64,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.97,0:38:31.95,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}To be born to a humble background is not shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.80,0:38:36.49,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}A great man can bend and stretch at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.96,0:38:42.56,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}Master Sun said,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.56,0:38:45.53,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}"An army is like water."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.53,0:38:48.87,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Water avoids high heights\N and moves towards low heights."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.87,0:38:52.21,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}"An army avoids the strong and attacks the weak."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.01,0:38:58.45,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}Jiang Wei experienced consecutive defeats, yet he has not withdrawn
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.45,0:39:00.70,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640, 660)}and has been fighting us day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.70,0:39:06.41,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,{\bord12}For him to use my family business to lure us out is quite strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.74,0:39:16.01,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Could Jiang Wei have sent troops\N to raid the nine camps at Mount Qi?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.02,0:39:19.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.667,457.333)}Sīmǎ Wàng\NStyled: Zǐchū
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.52,0:39:19.43,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,Your guess seems most right!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.86,0:39:23.30,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Shi Zuan, who guards Mount Qi,\N lacks both troops and intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.30,0:39:24.97,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,He will be in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.42,0:39:27.55,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,I shall move to reinforce him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.60,0:39:29.09,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,General Sima.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.09,0:39:30.25,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.25,0:39:33.20,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Defend this area. Do not leave if they challenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.20,0:39:33.45,Default,Sima Wang,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.45,0:39:34.22,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Deng Zhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.22,0:39:34.91,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.91,0:39:37.59,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Mobilize the army and follow me to Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.59,0:39:38.22,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.11,0:39:42.96,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Grand General, Deng Ai\N is attacking our camp at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.96,0:39:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Investigate!\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.74,0:39:48.63,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,So Deng Ai has come to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.39,0:39:51.61,Default,General,0,0,0,,I am willing to lead troops to fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.61,0:39:54.12,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.80,0:39:58.52,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Generals, defend the camp. \NDo not do anything reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.28,0:40:00.30,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Do not do anything rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.68,0:40:03.46,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.49,0:40:14.46,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Grand General!
